Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(2d): name stock bands in narrow-tool refusals

Add stock-source context to the existing 2D clearing refusal.
Name controlled rectangular side margins, tool size and stock to leave.
Keep other refusal messages and generated paths unchanged.
Pin the plate reproduction, boundary changes, leave, units and curved fallback.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #3791
